# clausal: no-collect
# Imports a functor that is already DEFINED (impclob_owner supplies two
# clauses) and then defines a clause for it.  Loading this used to overwrite
# the owner's clause list, deleting red and green from the OWNER's own
# queries.  It must now be refused at load time.
-module(impclob_redefine, [impclob_colour(NAME)])
-import_from(tests.fixtures.impclob_owner, [impclob_colour])
-private([blue])

impclob_colour(blue),
